    claim, or, if you paid us nothing (as is the case for the free Service), to SGD 100. Some
    jurisdictions do not allow these limits, so they may not fully apply to you.
  </p>

  <h2 id="indemnity">10. Indemnity</h2>
  <p>
    You agree to indemnify and hold Atomic harmless from any claims, losses, or costs (including
    reasonable legal fees) arising from your misuse of the Service or your breach of these Terms or of
