    These Terms are governed by the laws of Singapore, without regard to its conflict-of-laws rules. You
    and we agree to submit to the exclusive jurisdiction of the courts of Singapore for any dispute
    arising out of or relating to these Terms or the Service, except where mandatory local consumer law
    gives you the right to bring a claim elsewhere.
  </p>

  <h2 id="changes">13. Changes to these terms</h2>
  <p>
    We may update these Terms from time to time. When we make material changes, we will update the "Last
    updated" date above and, where appropriate, let you know. If you keep using the Service after a
    change takes effect, you accept the new Terms.
  </p>

  <h2 id="contact">14. Contact us</h2>
  <p>Questions about these Terms? Get in touch:</p>
  <p>
    <strong>Atomic BI Pte. Ltd.</strong><br />
    Email: <a href="mailto:tobias.strebitzer@atomic.bi">tobias.strebitzer@atomic.bi</a>
  </p>

  <ul class="next-links">
    <li><a href="/privacy">Privacy Policy &rarr;<span>What we collect and why</span></a></li>
    <li><a href="/docs">Documentation &rarr;<span>Build with the toolkit</span></a></li>
  </ul>
</PageLayout>
